.TH std::inplace_vector::begin,std::inplace_vector::cbegin 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::inplace_vector::begin,std::inplace_vector::cbegin \- std::inplace_vector::begin,std::inplace_vector::cbegin

.SH Synopsis
constexpr iterator begin() noexcept;              \fB(1)\fP (since C++26)
constexpr const_iterator begin() const noexcept;  \fB(2)\fP (since C++26)
constexpr const_iterator cbegin() const noexcept; \fB(3)\fP (since C++26)

Returns an iterator to the first element of the inplace_vector.

If the inplace_vector is empty, the returned iterator will be equal to end().

range-begin-end.svg

.SH Parameters

\fI(none)\fP

.SH Return value

Iterator to the first element.

.SH Complexity

Constant.

